# Spectral rule changes

Follow `AGENTS.md` and `.cursor/skills/add-spectral-rule/SKILL.md`.

## Names and tags

- Rule id: `{tas|tdp}-{target}-{rule}` (e.g. `tas-trn-format`)
- Shared rules: tags `R2023.1` and `R2026.1`
- r2026-only: tag `R2026.1` only, and set the rule to `off` in `spectral-r2023.1.yaml`

## Functions

```js
module.exports = (input, _opts, context) => {
  if (!input || typeof input !== "object") return [];
  const path = context.path || context.target || [];
  return [{ message: "{{clear error}}", path: [...path, "field"] }];
};
```

Register the kebab-case filename under `functions:` in `spectral.yaml`. Return `[]` for non-applicable input; do not throw.

## Tests

```js
const { linterForRule } = require("./utils");
beforeAll(async () => {
  linter = await linterForRule("tas-example-rule");
});
```

Cover at least one fail and one pass. File: `test/operation-<descriptor>.test.js`.

## Docs (same change)

Update `docs/RULES.md`, `docs/VERSION-MATRIX.md`, the README rule list, and `### <rule-name>` in `openapi-style-guide.md`.
